fect_detector.py`): Handles both detection mode (bounding boxes via `result.boxes`) AND classification mode (softmax via `result.probs`). Confidence < 0.25 → `NOVEL`, 0.25–0.45 → `UNCERTAIN`, ≥ 0.45 → hard class. Model cached in `_model_cache` dict keyed by path.\n\n2. **Production analysis** (`production_analyzer.py`): Uses flexible column-name aliasing via `STATION_COLS` dict in `constants.py`. Handles both 0–1 and 0–100 utilisation ranges (auto-detects: if raw value > 1.5, divides by 100). Bottleneck = station with max utilisation. WIP via Little's Law: `WIP = (parts_per_hour / 60) × waiting_time`.\n\n3. **Root-cause rules** (`constants.py`, `CORRELATION_RULES` list): 7 rules, each a lambda on a `flat_row` dict where keys are like `\"Drilling Util\"`, `\"Assembly Waiting Time\"`. Rules trigger on specific threshold violations and map to defect types. Cards sorted HIGH→MEDIUM→LOW, then observed defects first.\n\n4. **Financial model** (`profitability.py`): \n   - `unit_revenue = scrap_cost × revenue_multiplier` (default 4×)\n   - `scrap_material_loss = scrap_units × scrap_cost_per_unit`\n   - `bottleneck_idle_loss = bn_wait × downtime_cost_per_min`\n   - `opportunity_loss = throughput_gap × unit_revenue`\n   - `rework_cost_total = scrap_units × scrap_cost × 0.4 × 0.3`\n\n5. **Session state keys** in `app.py`: `registry` (DefectRegistry), `model_data` (dict name→DataFrame), `analyses` (dict name→analysis dict), `yolo_model`, `model_load_error`.\n\n6. **Auto-loading**: The app tries to load CSVs from `D:\\acceleration\\Model 1.csv`, `Model 2.csv`, `Model 3.csv` automatically on startup if session is empty. Same for `best.pt` — checked at `D:\\acceleration\\best.pt` first.\n\n### Constraints\n- **ultralytics import guard**: `YOLO_AVAILABLE` flag handles graceful degradation if not installed.\n- **PIL font fallback**: `ImageFont.truetype(\"arial.ttf\")` falls back to `load_default()` — this works on Windows but may vary.\n- **xlrd**: Needed for `.xls` files (ParametersFile.xls). `openpyxl` for `.xlsx`. Both in `requirements.txt`.\n- The `Model 3.csv` has 77 features — the analyzer picks only the station columns it recognises via alias matching. Unknown columns are silently ignored.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited/Created Files\n\n| Path | What/Why |\n|---|---|\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\app.py` | Main Streamlit app — full 4-tab layout, sidebar, KPI strip, evidence cards HTML |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\modules\\defect_detector.py` | YOLOv8 wrapper (detection + classification modes, annotation, uncertainty) |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\modules\\defect_registry.py` | Session store for per-unit results + drift dataframe |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\modules\\production_analyzer.py` | TOC engine — load_csv, analyze, compare_models, estimate_wip |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\modules\\root_cause.py` | correlate(), drift_analysis(), flag_novel() |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\modules\\profitability.py` | compute_financials(), what_if(), impact_delta() |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\modules\\__init__.py` | Package |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\utils\\constants.py` | DEFECT_CLASSES, thresholds, STATION_COLS, CORRELATION_RULES (7 rules) |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\utils\\chart_helpers.py` | Plotly factory: defect_donut, utilization_bar, waiting_time_bar, financial_waterfall, multi_model_radar, margin_comparison_bar, defect_trend, defect_type_bar, confidence_histogram |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\utils\\__init__.py` | Package |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\requirements.txt` | streamlit, ultralytics, Pillow, panda